              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba ali w'amagezi akukira abantu boona, w'amagezi okukira Esani Omunyazeraani, Hemani, Katukooli, na Darada batabani ba Mahooli; akarangaanwa omu mahanga goona agakaba gamuheriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
