              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baarugaga omu mahanga goona kandi baatumwaga abakama ab'ensi yoona, baija kuhurra amagezi ga Solomooni.",
          "type": "text",
